        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kujitala Ituku ja Mapatano",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ihi niyo sharia enugha matuku ghenyu ghose ghichagha: Ituku ja ikumi ja mori ghwa mfungade, Waisraeli wose, na waghenyi wose mkwanye, mchafunga tumu; ndemchaabonya kazi ingi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.26+LEV.23.27+LEV.23.28+LEV.23.29+LEV.23.30+LEV.23.31+LEV.23.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wal. 23.26-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.29.7+NUM.29.8+NUM.29.9+NUM.29.10+NUM.29.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mit. 29.7-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu ituku iji mapatano ghichabonywa kwa wundu ghonyu; mpate kueleshwa kufuma kwa kaung'a renyu rose, nenyo mchakaia muelie imbiri ya BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku ijo jichakaia jielie na ndighi konyu, nenyo mchafunga tumu na kuhora; msebonye kazi ingi. Sharia ihi ichanughwa matuku ghose ghichagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkohani M'baa ushingilo mavuda, na kuwikwa wakfu upate kughuwada wudumiki ghwa ndee, nuo uchaabonya mapatano nyuma ya kurwa nguwo ra wukohani riboie ra kitani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nao uchabonya mapatano kwa wundu ghwa kuelesha Andu kwa Wueli Kuchumbie, Hema ekwania, na madhabahu. Uchabonya mapatano kwa wundu ghwa wakohani na ikwanyiko jose ja wandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihi ichakaia sharia ya kala na kala kwa wundu ghonyu, eri mapatano ghipate kubonywa kwa wundu ghwa wandu wa Israeli kula mwaka; kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a rawo.” Musa ukabonya sa iji koni BWANA oremlaghirieghe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
